! Check "errors-cleared" for net-duplex-mismatch: No new CRC or late-collision errors on Gi0/3
! The runner sends each command line to SW-ACC-01 and matches the combined output against
! every "! expect:" (must match) and "! expect-not:" (must not match) regex. All must hold to pass.
clear counters GigabitEthernet0/3

! runner: wait 60
show interfaces GigabitEthernet0/3
! expect: \b0 input errors, 0 CRC
! expect: \b0 late collision
